  "html": "<div class=\"task note-list\"><h3>Questions 11–20</h3><p class=\"instructions\">Complete the notes. Write <strong>NO MORE THAN TWO WORDS AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><h4 class=\"task-title\">Rubbish Collection</h4><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Green bin</div><div class=\"form-row \">Advantages</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>easy to manage</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span><input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"11\" id=\"q11\" name=\"q11\" placeholder=\"11\" aria-label=\"Question 11\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>reusable</div><div class=\"form-row \">Remember</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>place close to road with access to truck</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>don’t <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"12\" id=\"q12\" name=\"q12\" placeholder=\"12\" aria-label=\"Question 12\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> it</div><div class=\"form-row \">Green bin NOT for</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span><input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"13\" id=\"q13\" name=\"q13\" placeholder=\"13\" aria-label=\"Question 13\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> waste (e.g. wood)</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>hazardous waste</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>very <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"14\" id=\"q14\" name=\"q14\" placeholder=\"14\" aria-label=\"Question 14\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> items</div><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Blue recycling bin</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>don’t put items in a <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"15\" id=\"q15\" name=\"q15\" placeholder=\"15\" aria-label=\"Question 15\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>every house can have up to three bins</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>extra material can be put in any <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"16\" id=\"q16\" name=\"q16\" placeholder=\"16\" aria-label=\"Question 16\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> container</div><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Bin emptying service</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>some collections are at night due to <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"17\" id=\"q17\" name=\"q17\" placeholder=\"17\" aria-label=\"Question 17\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> problems</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>night collections generally happen in <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"18\" id=\"q18\" name=\"q18\" placeholder=\"18\" aria-label=\"Question 18\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"> districts</div><div class=\"form-row section-heading\">Garden waste</div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>collections are made every <input class=\"gap choice-gap\" data-q=\"19\" id=\"q19\" name=\"q19\" placeholder=\"19\" aria-label=\"Question 19\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" data-min-width=\"135\" style=\"--listening-gap-width:135px\"></div><div class=\"form-row indented\"><span class=\"bullet\">•</span>choice of garden bag or bin</div><di